        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Garber\n- Works: I Had Three Wives, Godspell, Assassins, Alias, Lend Me a Tenor, Titanic, Argo\n- Roles: Jesus, Anthony Hope, John Wilkes Booth, Jack Bristow, Max, Thomas Andrews, Ken Taylor\n\nFacts:\n- Victor Garber had his first starring role on television as the lead of the series \"I Had Three Wives\".\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jesus in \"Godspell\".\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Anthony Hope.\n- Victor Garber is known for playing John Wilkes Booth in \"Assassins\".\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jack Bristow in the television series \"Alias\".\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Max in \"Lend Me a Tenor\".\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Thomas Andrews in James Cameron's \"Titanic\".\n- Victor Garber is known for portraying Ken Taylor, the Canadian Ambassador to Iran, in \"Argo\".",
